Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:26.39,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.35,0:01:41.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cause you couldn't\Nrun if you wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:52.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hakugan, get\Nto the Polar Tang!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:02:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger! Shachi, penguin,\Ninto the sea! Leave it to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.57,0:02:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.15,0:02:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Amputate!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.06,0:02:31.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that an awakened\Ntechnique?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.30,0:02:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When did you\Nlearn to do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.69,0:02:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did it, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.93,0:02:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.28,0:02:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drinking bastard,\Nyou fake your spider!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.80,0:02:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.58,0:02:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Dribble!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.85,0:02:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.22,0:03:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say it ain't so.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.56,0:03:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong, you were\Ntaken too soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's galloping\Nthrough heaven now.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.06,0:03:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.00,0:03:46.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Payback time!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.96,0:03:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look up!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something falling!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.82,0:03:56.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.01,0:03:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The apples are bombs!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.65,0:04:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.27,0:04:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were born and raised at the coldest\Npart in the North Blue, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.74,0:04:28.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You may be tough, but there's\Nno way you can beat us at sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.54,0:04:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're about to sink your ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.64,0:04:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(108,0)}Prepare to attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.36,0:04:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.92,0:04:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jean Bart!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.67,0:04:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three o'clock!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.01,0:04:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sniper!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.92,0:04:59.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready to block!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.38,0:05:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.10,0:05:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.06,0:05:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His defenses may\Nprove hard to break.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.50,0:05:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}K.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.94,0:05:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Room!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.95,0:05:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.79,0:05:20.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rool, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.88,0:05:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.78,0:05:27.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rool, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.25,0:05:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that supposed\Nto hurt you, idiot?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.80,0:05:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shock feeler.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.72,0:05:39.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.20,0:05:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Predictable.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.24,0:05:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't just charge\Nin without a strategy.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.75,0:05:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, warp.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.70,0:05:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.66,0:05:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Commodore, would you\Nlike to return to the ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.12,0:05:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.61,0:05:58.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.64,0:06:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started here!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.50,0:06:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.56,0:06:04.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Warp!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.92,0:06:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pfft!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.66,0:06:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.51,0:06:14.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.25,0:06:15.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.88,0:06:17.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Blackbeard!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.37,0:06:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All your top officers\Nhave devil fruit powers.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.07,0:06:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.16,0:06:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.07,0:06:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means all your best fighters\Nare weak against the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.17,0:06:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.09,0:06:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After seeing the kind of power we've got,\Nyou don't think that's a fair trade.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.15,0:06:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Room!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.97,0:06:35.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.85,0:06:39.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Takt!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.62,0:06:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}K.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.54,0:06:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Room!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.14,0:06:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack from below!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastards are trying\Nto sink our ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.35,0:07:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell are they\Nthis strong at sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.55,0:07:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is wild!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.77,0:07:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.39,0:07:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.73,0:07:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All they're doing is\Nshaking us around a bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.91,0:07:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It won't last long.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.55,0:07:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one in the world can stand\Nup against our commodore.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.06,0:07:34.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Mama is still alive, you won't\Nbe talking that way much longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.07,0:07:38.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.55,0:07:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If she's alive, we're fighting\Nthe guy who killed her right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.48,0:07:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That old bat and her era are as dead\Nas your hopes of getting out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.73,0:07:53.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A short time ago on Cacao Island,\Ntwo intruders suddenly appeared in...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.57,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Chocolat Town, where\NPudding resigned.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.07,0:08:23.29,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The goal of the intruders\Nwas to abduct Pudding.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.42,0:08:26.90,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,They were from\Nthe Blackbeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.06,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,One was the longtime\Nmember of Van Ogre.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.14,0:08:33.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other... was Kuzan.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.88,0:08:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know what you're expecting.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.98,0:08:40.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you think you can force\Nmy hand, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll never get\Nwhat you want.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.39,0:08:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Black Vortex!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.41,0:09:02.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reports say that Blackbeard and Trafalgar\NLaw are clashing at Winter Island in the...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.14,0:09:02.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,New World.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.77,0:09:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the problem\Nwith being fleet admiral.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.54,0:09:09.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to sit here and wait,\Ninstead of wringing their necks.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.97,0:09:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.28,0:09:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, that was weird, but I\Nthink we're in the clear now.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.21,0:09:24.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.06,0:09:29.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you made me any older, my bones\Nwould have turned to dust when I fell down.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get why you're upset.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But pacifistas are dangerous.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.90,0:09:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there's lots of them, so you better\Nget used to watching us beat your dad's ass.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.28,0:09:41.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.11,0:09:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know this is hard, Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.35,0:09:46.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really do.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.51,0:09:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we've dealt\Nwith pacifistas.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.04,0:09:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifistas in the past,\Nso just trust us, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.81,0:09:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, if it's not too much trouble,\Nplease turn me back before I die.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should have thought of this.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.92,0:10:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma was a normal human before\Nthey started cloning him, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.61,0:10:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course he'd have\Na family out there.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.85,0:10:11.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me get something\Nstraight with you, Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.39,0:10:13.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't be offended.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.88,0:10:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I heard that Kuma was the Wicked\NKing of the Sorbet Kingdom.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.12,0:10:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who was expelled by its people\Nand became a pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.25,0:10:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Later, he joined up\Nwith the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.92,0:10:26.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But was arrested by the Navy\Nand sentenced to life in prison.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.58,0:10:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Doctor Vegapunk\Ntook an interest in him.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.41,0:10:33.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He saw potential\Nin his unique physiology.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.22,0:10:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so, Kuma was allowed to return\Nto the seas as one of the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.48,0:10:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he had to agree to cloning\Nand body augmentation, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.43,0:10:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that correct?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.07,0:10:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.32,0:10:48.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Warlord part and the cloning\Npart do make sense to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the cyborg part?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.47,0:10:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's like a death sentence.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.13,0:10:56.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one would agree to have\Ntheir whole mind taken away like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.16,0:10:57.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know his crimes.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.75,0:11:00.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I don't know what\Nkind of deal he agreed to.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.90,0:11:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they called him Kuma the Tyrant\Nand gave him a life sentence.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.70,0:11:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a lie!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.61,0:11:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My dad wasn't a tyrant!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.11,0:11:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm positive that he\Nhated the world government.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.37,0:11:15.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'd never help\Nthem by choice!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.17,0:11:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They did these things\Nto him against his will!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.52,0:11:19.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill us?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.23,0:11:21.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know I can't\Nmove fast anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that weapon was\Npretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.64,0:11:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bless my bones!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that a beam saber?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There isn't much\Nthat works here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.60,0:11:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All these must be\Nrejected inventions.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.35,0:11:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this one's good.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.80,0:11:37.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk has to pay.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.25,0:11:39.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He committed murder\Nin the name of science!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.34,0:11:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My father said he came from\Na special race of people.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.06,0:11:57.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.66,0:11:58.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.64,0:12:01.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't give people\Nthe right to experiment on him!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.40,0:12:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't give them\Nthe right to erase his mind!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.14,0:12:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell him!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.68,0:12:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A special race, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.91,0:12:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You forgot to turn me back.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.78,0:12:21.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can fly!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.62,0:12:24.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you gotta make us\None of these, Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.10,0:12:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.51,0:12:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegaforce-01 is propelled\Nby the jets on its back.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.01,0:12:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's kept afloat by\Nan anti-gravity device.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.86,0:12:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh dang!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.97,0:12:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only possible because\Nof the air regulation on the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.94,0:12:39.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I want to take\Nit worldwide!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.50,0:12:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.05,0:12:42.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A city!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.60,0:12:43.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.72,0:12:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen architecture\Nlike that before.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.78,0:12:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And up we go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.20,0:12:56.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.03,0:12:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a giant\Nmonster down there!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.24,0:12:59.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh man!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.27,0:13:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And another giant robot!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.82,0:13:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many of them got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.51,0:13:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, Franky, Franky,\Ncheck out the flying fish!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do they have\Nanti-gravity devices too?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.78,0:13:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's straight out\Nof a Sci-Fi story!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.64,0:13:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.84,0:13:14.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We specialize in building\Nthe future here!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.56,0:13:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the future island!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.00,0:13:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Egghead!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.89,0:13:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Above the clouds is\Nthe laboratory level, Labophase.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.07,0:13:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Below is the factory\Nlevel, Fabriophase.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.81,0:13:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's where all the workers\Nand researchers live.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.46,0:13:35.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your captain's down there breaking\Nstuff like a caveman in a cryo center.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.06,0:13:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to know he's all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.83,0:13:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.78,0:13:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.47,0:13:50.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of cool stuff\Nare we gonna see next?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.14,0:13:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.62,0:13:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.43,0:13:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you guys coming?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.69,0:13:53.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.69,0:13:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on ship watch.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.13,0:13:57.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't take risks.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.34,0:13:58.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't trust that woman.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.59,0:14:00.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Course not.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.39,0:14:01.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're an asshole.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him, Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.51,0:14:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We all think you're great!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.03,0:14:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.41,0:14:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try it and see.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.92,0:14:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean just step on it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.43,0:14:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just like Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.95,0:14:17.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.44,0:14:18.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I wanna try!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.49,0:14:19.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.15,0:14:19.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.94,0:14:22.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.68,0:14:25.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It really takes me back!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.24,0:14:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the first time for me,\Nbut I'm diggin' it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.22,0:14:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have\Nbeen there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.06,0:14:31.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So did Vegapunk make\Nthese clouds, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.48,0:14:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.01,0:14:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.91,0:14:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can probably tell, but by controlling\Nthe island's air systems, I was able
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.99,0:14:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to modify the density of pyrobroin and water\Nvapor in the condensation nuclei
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.95,0:14:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and recreate the island clouds\Nand sea clouds of Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.86,0:14:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those have gotta\Nbe made up words.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.49,0:14:49.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And this is\Nthe entrance to the lab!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.71,0:14:50.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.31,0:14:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.78,0:14:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll need to put on research\Nsuits before you go in.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.40,0:15:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are changing rooms\Nthrough the trancos on the sides.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.67,0:15:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please choose\Nyour preferred clothing style.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.68,0:15:08.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, but how do I do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.21,0:15:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's touching me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.45,0:15:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pull the levers on your dom\Nshoes to adjust the size!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.49,0:15:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll fit any type of foot!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.61,0:15:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These things, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.83,0:15:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know, they\Nlook pretty bulky.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.74,0:15:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're so light!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.35,0:15:30.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And adorable!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.83,0:15:33.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a killer\Nlook, Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.93,0:15:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Love it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.48,0:15:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So these clothes\Ncan reshape?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.21,0:15:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet they could strangle\Nus to death.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.89,0:15:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would you\Neven say that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.61,0:15:42.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.99,0:15:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Future Usopp\Ncoming through!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.61,0:15:46.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk is the man!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.08,0:15:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His clothes even fit cyborgs!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.67,0:15:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.62,0:15:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mine's just a normal\NAloha shirt.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.79,0:15:56.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But who cares about me?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.34,0:15:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ladies look nice!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.27,0:15:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's different, but it's comfy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.86,0:16:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look ready\Nto kick ass, Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.90,0:16:02.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do I?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look like a perv\Nin any outfit!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.77,0:16:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.25,0:16:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some say that foresight\Nis a genius's blessing.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.31,0:16:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I'm inclined\Nto call it a curse.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.72,0:16:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You know I can't stand it when\Nyou talk in riddles, Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.23,0:16:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be frank.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.06,0:16:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.30,0:16:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.74,0:16:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed\Nto be a joke?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.67,0:16:29.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just wanted you to know\Nbefore it happens.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.85,0:16:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Dragon.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.45,0:16:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, why didn't you go\Nalong with the others?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.35,0:16:37.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on standby\Nto go rescue them.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.45,0:16:38.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a government island.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're probably\Nwalking into a trap.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.57,0:16:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, I had\Nthe exact same thought.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, would you\Ncare for some tea?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.71,0:16:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.46,0:16:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, pal.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.50,0:16:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, good sirs!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.48,0:16:50.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.88,0:16:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.59,0:16:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.12,0:16:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cruel!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.66,0:16:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know the deal was that you'd give\Nme a ride anywhere outside of Wano,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.99,0:16:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I can't get off here!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.68,0:17:01.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you said,\Nit's a government island!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly welcome!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.29,0:17:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you helping out\Nour captain, but we're done.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.13,0:17:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.39,0:17:10.39,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay\Nfor this someday!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The stairs move?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.84,0:17:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.51,0:17:24.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, riding these stairs in style!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like climbing\Na soap yesterday!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.18,0:17:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The steps are pouring\Nout from the ground!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.11,0:17:31.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is so crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.04,0:17:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How does this thing work?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.45,0:17:36.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's it run on?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.03,0:17:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything on the island\Nis powered by fire.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.44,0:17:41.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flames can be converted\Nto all forms of energy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.07,0:17:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you need\Nnatural resources?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.31,0:17:48.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've done a lot of research on what\Nmatter is most efficient to burn.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.73,0:17:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what I really want is an undying\Nflame, so I can make a sun!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.42,0:17:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make a sun?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.98,0:18:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're walking into a wall!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.54,0:18:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.71,0:18:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open the wall thingy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.50,0:18:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just walk through it like I did!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.37,0:18:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trust your brains,\Nnot your eyes!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.69,0:18:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.73,0:18:16.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you yelling, Edison?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.79,0:18:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.22,0:18:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith, my evil queen!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.98,0:18:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't hear anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.97,0:18:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did she leave us?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.01,0:18:29.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good, Edison!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.03,0:18:31.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.19,0:18:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he had really been decapitated,\Nthere'd be blood everywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.28,0:18:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that\Nabsolutely terrible...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.00,0:18:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Terrifying analysis!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.79,0:18:38.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.77,0:18:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.82,0:18:40.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.07,0:18:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can just walk\Nright through.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.66,0:18:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I better not break my nose.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.64,0:18:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me try!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.53,0:18:47.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neat!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not you too!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.70,0:18:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bye, Lisa!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.33,0:18:52.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I passed through.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.07,0:18:53.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.31,0:18:57.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fwaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.24,0:19:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jeez, why are you\Ntrying to confuse me?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.57,0:19:04.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh heh!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.10,0:19:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's totally solid when\Nyou go through!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.15,0:19:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How does this even work?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.03,0:19:13.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, where did Lilith go?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.43,0:19:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.56,0:19:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Walk straight ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.91,0:19:18.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.89,0:19:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, I'm Vegapunk Edison,\Nat your service!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.05,0:19:23.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome to the lab.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.37,0:19:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll guide you from here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.22,0:19:30.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep going.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.76,0:19:33.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm ever gonna\Nfigure out this weird place.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.03,0:19:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hunt for some\Nfuture treasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.00,0:19:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now what would that\Nbe exactly?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.29,0:19:39.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like pretty, pretty flowers.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.55,0:19:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Made of money.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.75,0:19:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you a little Princess\Nor a greedy old bag?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.12,0:19:45.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Future kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.91,0:19:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Future pain!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.86,0:20:02.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone's in there.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.82,0:20:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.46,0:20:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.13,0:20:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.49,0:20:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Jinbe!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.32,0:20:10.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's too young.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.11,0:20:12.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he looks\Ndifferent somehow.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.71,0:20:19.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, the first option.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.30,0:20:20.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Jinbe's child.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.47,0:20:21.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Second option.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.48,0:20:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe was turned into a child.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.52,0:20:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.89,0:20:28.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Third option.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a lookalike.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.96,0:20:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With wings.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And a really weird vibe.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.99,0:20:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.84,0:20:36.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.42,0:20:40.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's big.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.72,0:20:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He might look like a kid,\Nbut he's as tall as the real Jinbe.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.46,0:20:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.34,0:20:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Option four!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.05,0:20:50.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a pacifista!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.10,0:20:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.62,0:20:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.89,0:21:16.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.16,0:21:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew this had to be\Na government trap!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.94,0:21:18.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just knew it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.52,0:21:19.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.88,0:21:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.74,0:21:24.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem\Nto recall that name.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.81,0:21:26.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or any of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.17,0:21:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it was worth a shot.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.56,0:21:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I guess he's\Nnot our friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.79,0:21:35.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe aside,\Nthis still feels wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.93,0:21:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure, he's kinda big,\Nbut he looks like a kid to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.20,0:21:43.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.57,0:21:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit Power!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.76,0:21:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.28,0:21:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.52,0:21:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we doing this?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.54,0:21:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.29,0:21:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.62,0:22:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.54,0:22:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that power!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.75,0:22:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how did he get it too?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.20,0:22:08.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.57,0:22:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.46,0:22:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.58,0:22:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.44,0:22:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jin... Jinbe...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.50,0:22:27.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said let her go, you bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.81,0:22:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want to throw hands!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.45,0:22:33.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I will mess you up,\Neven if Vegapunk is my hero!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.84,0:22:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Death penalty, it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.09,0:22:42.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whether you're Jinbe or not,\NI'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.72,0:22:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you no mercy.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.52,0:22:55.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've made an enemy of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.86,0:22:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gigante Fleur!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.05,0:23:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sea serpent snapdragon!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.12,0:23:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Spank!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.24,0:23:25.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.82,0:23:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, get back!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.81,0:23:33.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's fishman karate!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.57,0:23:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.68,0:23:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Green star!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.92,0:23:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Skull Bombgrass!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.64,0:23:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get it together, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.95,0:23:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.87,0:23:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not the real Jinbe!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.06,0:23:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you get him?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.51,0:23:52.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.08,0:23:53.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think he's down.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.39,0:23:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.29,0:24:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.22,0:24:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I missed?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.27,0:24:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could I miss?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.15,0:24:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.01,0:24:11.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.02,0:24:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.72,0:24:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.09,0:24:18.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.01,0:24:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got this one!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.30,0:24:22.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.00,0:24:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stand perfectly still!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.74,0:24:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.48,0:24:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me die!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.52,0:24:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.30,0:24:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta stand still, bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.20,0:24:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't take this shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.86,0:24:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this energy\Nhe's using?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.02,0:24:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.00,0:24:40.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Radical!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.26,0:24:42.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}S-shark!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.40,0:24:43.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dodge now!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.91,0:24:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Beat!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.04,0:24:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can shoot lasers?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.40,0:24:59.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of pirate\Nshoots lasers?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.44,0:25:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If that had hit S-Shark,\Nit would have been a catastrophe.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.26,0:25:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The seraphim\Nare still children!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.46,0:25:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're not ready for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.42,0:25:09.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm not ready\Nfor laser tests yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.70,0:25:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.05,0:25:10.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the fulcrum!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.24,0:25:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who does that idiot think he is,\Nshooting up our expensive stuff?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.40,0:25:16.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rip his head\Noff and put it in a jar!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.16,0:25:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, too evil!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.46,0:25:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.95,0:25:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want me to be\Nnice to the pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.44,0:25:21.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.66,0:25:23.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those rats are\Ngonna die in this lab!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.73,0:25:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Way too evil!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.36,0:25:26.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, S-Shark!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.66,0:25:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to beat them\Ninto the ground!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.52,0:25:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Activate murder mode!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.79,0:25:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.08,0:25:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No murder mode!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.18,0:25:34.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I have more\Nthan enough test data to...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.73,0:25:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.86,0:25:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eureka!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.94,0:25:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just thought\Nof a new invention!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.76,0:25:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice work, buddy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.07,0:25:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You go do your thing,\NI'll hold down the fort for ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.47,0:25:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving you in charge.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.09,0:25:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pythagoras, say what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.56,0:25:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All over it, pal.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.02,0:25:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Data like this is\Nmy morning cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.63,0:25:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must draw up\Nthe blueprints post-haste!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.27,0:25:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So much work to be done!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.63,0:26:00.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come, my assistant!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.74,0:26:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sweet ontogenesis!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.26,0:26:12.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.69,0:26:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The seraphim's attack patterns are\Ncontinuing to develop as he grows!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.05,0:26:21.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As I hypothesized, it seems that experiences\Nare stored in their bloodline elements!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.38,0:26:22.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.38,0:26:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get those pirates' out!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.60,0:26:26.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, S-Shark!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.06,0:26:28.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at him go!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.61,0:26:31.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, they evolve into\Nwar machines so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.58,0:26:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heart rate of 90, and his green\Nblood concentration went up!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.57,0:26:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show them who's top\Nof the food chain!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.90,0:26:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make chowder out\Nof those chumps!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.20,0:27:02.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A cursed stomach!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.01,0:27:04.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why must you rumble so?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.20,0:27:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These revelations\Nare too important!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.17,0:27:09.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have time\Nto take a lunch break!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.96,0:27:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.51,0:27:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat something for me, York!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.01,0:27:15.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.91,0:27:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.77,0:27:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sweet nutrition!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.39,0:27:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's sucking into my brain!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.61,0:27:26.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ideas spring forth anew!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.94,0:27:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We brought everything\Nwe could grab!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.67,0:27:33.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.98,0:27:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, what\Nam I, dieting?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.00,0:27:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring more,\Nplease and thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.96,0:27:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.12,0:27:44.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.65,0:27:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the life!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.37,0:27:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,BMI is over 600!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.21,0:27:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat, BMI is over 600!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.38,0:27:59.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was done anyway!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.31,0:27:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, relax!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.51,0:28:02.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep it going, S-Shark!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.94,0:28:06.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,New battle data keeps\Npouring in by the second!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.49,0:28:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No... no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.99,0:28:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's call a temporary truce!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.37,0:28:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, this is no time\Nto drop a deuce!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.75,0:28:24.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, fellas!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.85,0:28:26.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm busy?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.63,0:28:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1616,1053)}Much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.39,0:28:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Digestion Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.57,0:28:45.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now for the experimental\Nphase!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.38,0:28:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring me all the data we\Nhave on devil fruit powers!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.58,0:28:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring devil fruit\Ndata to Pythagoras!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.97,0:28:53.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare for a animal\Nexperiment!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.13,0:28:54.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the simulation\Nroom immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.67,0:28:57.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sleepy...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.66,0:29:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The day isn't over and York\Nis on her fourth eat!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.59,0:29:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sleep!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.01,0:29:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.21,0:29:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going\Non with my feet?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.27,0:29:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seraphim, abort all\Nattack operations.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.92,0:29:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edison, Lilith, Pythagoras...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.94,0:29:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your experiment is over.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.66,0:29:33.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, well there goes my day.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.93,0:29:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's more just getting\Nto the good part!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.28,0:29:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid Killjoy!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.29,0:29:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eureka!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.66,0:29:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened,\Nbut I think that guy just saved us.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.22,0:29:56.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoever he is,\NI don't trust him one bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.62,0:29:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must be the guy\NLilith was talking to.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.29,0:30:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.12,0:30:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could he be?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.77,0:30:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.47,0:30:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaka the Good.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.89,0:30:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Another Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.44,0:30:12.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kinda overdoing it,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.57,0:30:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you are the famous\NStraw Hat crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.29,0:30:16.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pleasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.37,0:30:19.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now can you tell us why\Nour shoes are stuck to the floor?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.31,0:30:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dom's shoes are magnetized.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.32,0:30:23.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can control them\Nremotely inside the lab.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.91,0:30:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Resistance is futile, I take it.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.83,0:30:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot trust pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.91,0:30:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, but are you\Nreally Dr. Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.45,0:30:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because you're like\Nthe third one we met today!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.98,0:30:34.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.99,0:30:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are all Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.11,0:30:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:38.44,0:30:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many\NVegapunks are there?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.26,0:30:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.48,0:30:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:43.20,0:30:44.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, bro.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.15,0:30:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you stop\Nembarrassing me?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.58,0:30:51.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.76,0:30:54.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does this island look\Nlike the future to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.71,0:30:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.60,0:30:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.06,0:30:58.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course it does!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.61,0:31:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got mechanical\Nmonsters out in the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.98,0:31:02.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegaforce-01 flying around.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.88,0:31:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Air and temperature\Nregulations everywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.05,0:31:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place looks like\Nthe super future.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.13,0:31:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The city here is like nothing\NI've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.29,0:31:12.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to check out that\Ntech from top to bottom.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:12.86,0:31:14.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island's\Nthe freaking bomb!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.94,0:31:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So don't be a hater, Vega bro.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.03,0:31:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us go explore it.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.35,0:31:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty please?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.64,0:31:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It will never surpass\Nits predecessor.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.09,0:31:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.50,0:31:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island is the past.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.49,0:31:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you\Ncall it the past?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.32,0:31:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hypothetically speaking, if I told you\Nthere was an advanced kingdom,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.36,0:31:44.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,much like this island, that existed 900\Nyears ago, would you believe me?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:45.05,0:31:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, like 9-0-0?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:47.08,0:31:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's crazy talk, bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.30,0:31:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, look!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.00,0:31:57.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really real!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.22,0:31:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not a half of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:58.71,0:32:00.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta come check this out!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.10,0:32:00.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.95,0:32:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's metal!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:05.80,0:32:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks impressive,\Nbut it's pretty beat up.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:09.46,0:32:11.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think this thing\Nused to move around?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.95,0:32:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that would be a stretch.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:13.51,0:32:16.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even with this island's tech,\Nit looks like it's quite old.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:16.97,0:32:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we ride it?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:18.51,0:32:19.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.29,0:32:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:20.65,0:32:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll race you to the top!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.84,0:15:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.43,0:24:16.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
